:2,"text":"Dreyfus passes Zehender for the lead and Wimille follows him through; Dreyfus lowers the record to 2m56s.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":3,"text":"On the third lap Wimille took over the lead from Dreyfus and lowered the lap record by another two seconds","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":4,"text":"Wimille takes another two seconds off the record; Zehender, third, is under attack from Falchetto.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":5,"text":"Zehender retires at the hairpin with a damaged engine bearing.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":5,"text":"Rey stopped his Bugatti at La Salis on lap 5 and retired.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":7,"text":"Wimille skids and overturns his Monza at the curve near the sea; he is taken to hospital with face wounds.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":7,"text":"\"Ralph\" also retired on lap 7 with a mechanical problem.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":8,"text":"With Wimille missing, Dreyfus was now leading the race again but Falchetto was closing in on him. Sommer was third and further down Fourny had found a way past Gaupillat to take fourth position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":12,"text":"Dreyfus's injured shoulder is getting more and more painful.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":13,"text":"After the 13th lap Falchetto is just four seconds behind Dreyfus.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":14,"text":"Falchetto passes Dreyfus on the sea section; Moulin and Calmels retire.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":15,"text":"Sommer was third, holding off Fourcy, Gaupillat and Trintignant, who were having a fierce fight for fourth position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":18,"text":"The gap to Falchetto grows each lap, and after 18 laps Dreyfus retires.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":20,"text":"After 20 laps Falchetto leads Sommer by 1m23s; Sommer has pulled away from Gaupillat.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":25,"text":"So Falchetto took the victory with Sommer second and Gaupillat finishing third. Trintignant was fourth and Fourny dropped back during the last laps to finish fifth.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0}]}